    "detailed_description": "Arnold Sch\u00f6nberg's mono-opera &quot;Erwartung&quot;, which premiered in 1924, uses expressive tonal language to tell the story of a woman's anxiety when she stumbles upon a corpse in the woods at night while searching for her lover. Director Andr\u00e9 B\u00fccker's new virtual reality production transfers this emotional psychogram into a 360\u00b0 VR world. This offers an intense gaming experience in which Sch\u00f6nberg's music can be experienced in a completely new and immediate way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you put on the VR headset and pick up the controllers, you are immersed in a nocturnal, eerie forest in which a woman is searching for her lover. The player takes on the role of this woman, who wanders through the forest, and drives the plot forward through their own interactions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith &quot;Erwartung&quot;, Staatstheater Augsburg is taking the next step in its digital theatre programme and linking artistic stage works and digital media even more closely.",
    "about_the_game": "Arnold Sch\u00f6nberg's mono-opera &quot;Erwartung&quot;, which premiered in 1924, uses expressive tonal language to tell the story of a woman's anxiety when she stumbles upon a corpse in the woods at night while searching for her lover. Director Andr\u00e9 B\u00fccker's new virtual reality production transfers this emotional psychogram into a 360\u00b0 VR world. This offers an intense gaming experience in which Sch\u00f6nberg's music can be experienced in a completely new and immediate way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you put on the VR headset and pick up the controllers, you are immersed in a nocturnal, eerie forest in which a woman is searching for her lover. The player takes on the role of this woman, who wanders through the forest, and drives the plot forward through their own interactions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith &quot;Erwartung&quot;, Staatstheater Augsburg is taking the next step in its digital theatre programme and linking artistic stage works and digital media even more closely.",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a nocturnal, eerie forest in the virtual reality production of Arnold Sch\u00f6nberg's &quot;Erwartung&quot;. The anxiety of a woman who wanders through the forest in search of her lover becomes an intense performance experience through the expressive sound.",
